<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>JairoBet — Instructivo Polla Mundial 2026</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800;900&family=Black+Ops+One&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
:root{
  --col-y:#FCD116;
  --col-b:#003893;
  --col-r:#CE1126;
  --dark:#080C18;
  --card:#0E1525;
  --card2:#131D30;
  --text:#E8EAF0;
  --muted:#7A86A0;
  --green:#27AE60;
  --radius:16px;
}
body{
  font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;
  background:var(--dark);
  color:var(--text);
  min-height:100vh;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}

/* ═══════════ HERO ═══════════ */
.hero{
  position:relative;
  min-height:340px;
  background:linear-gradient(160deg, #001040 0%, #000820 50%, #100008 100%);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  padding:48px 24px 36px;
  overflow:hidden;
}
.hero-bg-flag{
  position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:8px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--col-y) 0%,var(--col-y) 40%,var(--col-b) 40%,var(--col-b) 70%,var(--col-r) 70%);
}
.hero-orb{
  position:absolute;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(60px);pointer-events:none;
}
.hero-orb.y{width:400px;height:400px;background:rgba(252,209,22,0.12);top:-100px;right:-80px;}
.hero-orb.b{width:300px;height:300px;background:rgba(0,56,147,0.18);bottom:-60px;left:-40px;}
.hero-orb.r{width:200px;height:200px;background:rgba(206,17,38,0.15);top:20px;left:30%;}

.hero-badge{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--col-y),#F0900A);
  color:#000;font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;
  font-size:13px;letter-spacing:4px;
  padding:5px 18px;border-radius:40px;
  margin-bottom:16px;
}
.hero-title{
  font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;
  font-size:clamp(42px,10vw,80px);
  line-height:0.9;text-align:center;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff 0%,var(--col-y) 60%,#F0900A 100%);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
  filter:drop-shadow(0 4px 24px rgba(252,209,22,0.3));
  position:relative;z-index:1;
}
.hero-sub{
  font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;
  font-size:clamp(18px,4vw,28px);
  letter-spacing:8px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
  margin-top:8px;position:relative;z-index:1;text-align:center;
}
.hero-flags{
  font-size:28px;margin-top:16px;letter-spacing:8px;
  position:relative;z-index:1;
}
.hero-dates{
  margin-top:16px;padding:10px 24px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);border-radius:40px;
  font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--col-y);
  letter-spacing:2px;position:relative;z-index:1;
}
.ball-float{
  position:absolute;top:24px;right:24px;font-size:64px;
  animation:ballFloat 4s ease-in-out infinite;z-index:2;
}
@keyframes ballFloat{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(0deg)}50%{transform:translateY(-14px) rotate(20deg)}}

/* ═══════════ LAYOUT ═══════════ */
.page{max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 80px;}

/* ═══════════ SECTION ═══════════ */
.section{
  margin-top:48px;
  position:relative;
}
.section-header{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;
  margin-bottom:24px;
}
.step-badge{
  width:48px;height:48px;min-width:48px;border-radius:14px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;font-size:22px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--col-y),#F0900A);
  color:#000;flex-shrink:0;
  box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(252,209,22,0.35);
}
.section-title{
  font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;
  font-size:clamp(22px,5vw,30px);
  line-height:1.1;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,rgba(255,255,255,0.7));
  -webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
}
.section-title em{
  font-style:normal;
  -webkit-text-fill-color:var(--col-y);
}

/* ═══════════ CARDS ═══════════ */
.card{
  background:var(--card);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  padding:20px 24px;
  margin-bottom:14px;
}
.card.accent-y{border-color:rgba(252,209,22,0.3);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(252,209,22,0.07),var(--card));}
.card.accent-b{border-color:rgba(0,56,147,0.4);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(0,56,147,0.12),var(--card));}
.card.accent-r{border-color:rgba(206,17,38,0.35);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(206,17,38,0.08),var(--card));}
.card.accent-g{border-color:rgba(39,174,96,0.35);background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(39,174,96,0.08),var(--card));}

/* ═══════════ STEPS ═══════════ */
.steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;}
.step-item{
  display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;
}
.step-num{
  width:36px;height:36px;min-width:36px;
  border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;font-size:16px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--col-b),#001560);
  color:var(--col-y);border:2px solid rgba(252,209,22,0.3);
}
.step-text strong{color:var(--col-y);}
.step-text{font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;}

/* ═══════════ SCORE TABLE ═══════════ */
.score-table{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0 6px;}
.score-table th{
  font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;letter-spacing:3px;font-size:13px;
  color:var(--muted);padding:4px 12px;text-align:left;
}
.score-table td{
  padding:12px 16px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;
}
.score-table tr.sr{background:var(--card2);border-radius:12px;}
.score-table tr.sr td:first-child{border-radius:12px 0 0 12px;}
.score-table tr.sr td:last-child{border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;}
.pts-big{
  font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;font-size:28px;
  color:var(--col-y);
}
.pts-med{font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;font-size:22px;color:var(--col-y);}
.tag{
  display:inline-block;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:6px;
  font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;
}
.tag.g{background:rgba(39,174,96,0.2);color:#2ecc71;}
.tag.y{background:rgba(252,209,22,0.2);color:var(--col-y);}
.tag.r{background:rgba(206,17,38,0.2);color:#ff6b6b;}
.tag.b{background:rgba(0,56,147,0.3);color:#5b9eff;}

/* ═══════════ EXAMPLE MATCH ═══════════ */
.match-card{
  background:var(--card2);border-radius:14px;
  padding:18px 20px;margin-bottom:10px;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.match-card::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;
}
.match-card.win::before{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--green),#1abc9c);}
.match-card.partial::before{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--col-y),#F0900A);}
.match-card.miss::before{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--col-r),#c0392b);}

.match-header{
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  margin-bottom:12px;
}
.match-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;}
.match-score{
  text-align:center;
  font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;font-size:32px;
  color:white;letter-spacing:4px;margin:4px 0;
}
.match-teams{
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;
  font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:var(--muted);
  text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;
}
.match-result{
  margin-top:12px;padding-top:12px;
  border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;
}
.result-pts{
  font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;font-size:22px;
}
.result-pts.win{color:var(--green);}
.result-pts.partial{color:var(--col-y);}
.result-pts.miss{color:#ff6b6b;}

/* ═══════════ ELIM TABLE ═══════════ */
.elim-table{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0 5px;}
.elim-table th{
  font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;letter-spacing:3px;font-size:12px;
  color:var(--muted);padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;
}
.elim-table td{
  padding:11px 12px;text-align:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;
  background:var(--card2);
}
.elim-table td:first-child{
  text-align:left;border-radius:10px 0 0 10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;
}
.elim-table td:last-child{border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;}
.elim-table .pts-g{color:#5b9eff;font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;font-size:18px;}
.elim-table .pts-e{color:var(--col-y);font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;font-size:18px;}
.elim-table .pts-a{color:#ff6fb0;font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;font-size:18px;}

/* ═══════════ ALERT BOXES ═══════════ */
.alert{
  border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;
  display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;
  margin:14px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;
}
.alert-icon{font-size:24px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;}
.alert.warn{background:rgba(252,209,22,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(252,209,22,0.25);}
.alert.warn .alert-text strong{color:var(--col-y);}
.alert.danger{background:rgba(206,17,38,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(206,17,38,0.3);}
.alert.danger .alert-text strong{color:#ff6b6b;}
.alert.info{background:rgba(0,56,147,0.15);border:1px solid rgba(0,56,147,0.35);}
.alert.info .alert-text strong{color:#5b9eff;}
.alert.success{background:rgba(39,174,96,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(39,174,96,0.3);}
.alert.success .alert-text strong{color:var(--green);}
.alert.colombia{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(252,209,22,0.1),rgba(0,56,147,0.1));
  border:2px solid rgba(252,209,22,0.4);
}

/* ═══════════ TIMELINE ═══════════ */
.timeline{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;}
.tl-item{
  display:flex;gap:0;position:relative;
}
.tl-left{
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;
  min-width:52px;
}
.tl-dot{
  width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;
  border:3px solid var(--col-y);background:var(--dark);
  z-index:1;margin-top:18px;
}
.tl-line{
  width:3px;flex:1;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(252,209,22,0.4),rgba(252,209,22,0.05));
  min-height:20px;
}
.tl-content{
  padding:14px 0 14px 12px;
  flex:1;
}
.tl-date{
  font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;
  font-size:13px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--col-y);
  margin-bottom:4px;
}
.tl-title{font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:white;margin-bottom:4px;}
.tl-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;}

/* ═══════════ PRIZES ═══════════ */
.prize-row{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:14px;}
.prize-box{
  flex:1;border-radius:16px;padding:20px 14px;text-align:center;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  background:var(--card);
  transition:transform .2s;
}
.prize-box:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);}
.prize-box.gold{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(252,209,22,0.15),rgba(252,209,22,0.04));
  border-color:rgba(252,209,22,0.4);
}
.prize-box.silver{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(192,192,192,0.1),rgba(192,192,192,0.03));
  border-color:rgba(192,192,192,0.25);
}
.prize-box.bronze{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(205,127,50,0.1),rgba(205,127,50,0.03));
  border-color:rgba(205,127,50,0.25);
}
.prize-emoji{font-size:40px;margin-bottom:8px;}
.prize-pct{
  font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;font-size:36px;
  color:var(--col-y);
}
.prize-box.silver .prize-pct{color:#C0C0C0;}
.prize-box.bronze .prize-pct{color:#CD7F32;}
.prize-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:4px;}

/* ═══════════ CTA ═══════════ */
.cta-section{
  margin-top:56px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(252,209,22,0.12),rgba(0,56,147,0.15));
  border:2px solid rgba(252,209,22,0.3);
  border-radius:24px;padding:36px 28px;text-align:center;
}
.cta-title{
  font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;
  font-size:clamp(24px,5vw,38px);
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--col-y),#F0900A);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
  margin-bottom:8px;
}
.cta-sub{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:24px;}
.cta-url{
  display:inline-block;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--col-y),#F0900A);
  color:#000;font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;
  font-size:18px;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:14px;
  text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:1px;
  box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(252,209,22,0.35);
  transition:all .2s;
}
.cta-url:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 14px 40px rgba(252,209,22,0.45);}
.cta-note{margin-top:16px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);}

/* ═══════════ DIVIDER ═══════════ */
.divider{
  height:1px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(252,209,22,0.2),rgba(0,56,147,0.3),rgba(206,17,38,0.2),transparent);
  margin:40px 0;
}

/* ═══════════ TIP BOX ═══════════ */
.tip{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(252,209,22,0.08),rgba(252,209,22,0.03));
  border-left:4px solid var(--col-y);
  border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;
  padding:14px 18px;
  font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;
  margin:14px 0;
}
.tip strong{color:var(--col-y);}

/* ═══════════ MAX POINTS ═══════════ */
.max-pts-bar{
  background:var(--card);border-radius:14px;padding:20px 24px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
  flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;
  border:1px solid rgba(252,209,22,0.2);
}
.max-pts-label{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;}
.max-pts-num{
  font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;font-size:42px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--col-y),#F0900A);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
}
.max-pts-sub{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);}

/* ═══════════ FLAG STRIPE ═══════════ */
.col-stripe{
  height:6px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--col-y) 0%,var(--col-y) 40%,var(--col-b) 40%,var(--col-b) 70%,var(--col-r) 70%);
  border-radius:4px;margin:28px 0;
}

/* ═══════════ COLOMBIA HIGHLIGHT ═══════════ */
.col-box{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(252,209,22,0.13),rgba(0,56,147,0.13),rgba(206,17,38,0.08));
  border:2px solid;
  border-image:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--col-y),var(--col-b),var(--col-r)) 1;
  border-radius:16px;
  padding:20px 24px;
  margin:14px 0;
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
}
.col-box::after{
  content:'🇨🇴';position:absolute;right:16px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);
  font-size:48px;opacity:0.15;
}

/* responsive */
@media(max-width:520px){
  .prize-row{flex-direction:column;}
  .elim-table{font-size:12px;}
  .elim-table .pts-g,.elim-table .pts-e,.elim-table .pts-a{font-size:15px;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ═══════════ HERO ═══════════ -->
<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-orb y"></div>
  <div class="hero-orb b"></div>
  <div class="hero-orb r"></div>
  <div class="ball-float">⚽</div>
  <div class="hero-badge">INSTRUCTIVO OFICIAL</div>
  <div class="hero-title">JAIROBET</div>
  <div class="hero-sub">POLLA MUNDIAL 2026</div>
  <div class="hero-flags">🇨🇦 🇲🇽 🇺🇸</div>
  <div class="hero-dates">📅 11 Junio — 19 Julio 2026</div>
  <div class="hero-bg-flag"></div>
</div>

<div class="page">

<!-- ═══════════ INTRO ═══════════ -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="card accent-y" style="text-align:center;padding:28px 24px;">
    <div style="font-size:48px;margin-bottom:12px">🏆</div>
    <div style="font-family:'Black Ops One',sans-serif;font-size:22px;color:white;margin-bottom:10px">¿De qué va esto?</div>
    <div style="font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto">
      Predice los marcadores de los partidos del Mundial 2026, acumula puntos y compite contra tus amigos.<br>
      <strong style="color:var(--col-y)">Quien más puntos acumule, se lleva el premio. 💰</strong>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-pts-bar">
    <div>
      <div class="max-pts-label">PUNTOS MÁXIMOS POSIBLES</div>
      <div class="max-pts-sub">Si aciertas absolutamente todo 🤯</div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:right">
      <div class="max-pts-num">355</div>
      <div class="max-pts-sub">puntos</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="divider"></div>

<!-- ═══════════ PASO 1: REGISTRO ═══════════ -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="step-badge">1</div>
    <div class="section-title">REGÍSTRATE &amp; <em>ENTRA</em></div>
  </div>

  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step-item">
      <div class="step-num">1</div>
      <div class="step-text">
        Entra a la app: <strong>jairocaranton-a11y.github.io/jairobet</strong><br>
        <span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Funciona en celular y computador, no necesitas instalar nada.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step-item">
      <div class="step-num">2</div>
      <div class="step-text">
        Toca <strong>"Quiero registrarme"</strong>, escribe tu nombre completo y elige el equipo que crees será <strong>campeón del mundo</strong>.
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step-item">
      <div class="step-num">3</div>
      <div class="step-text">
        La app te genera un <strong>código único de 6 caracteres</strong> (ej: <span style="font-family:monospace;background:rgba(252,209,22,0.15);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;color:var(--col-y)">X4KR7J</span>).<br>
        <strong style="color:#ff6b6b">¡Guárdalo! Es tu llave para siempre.</strong> Si lo pierdes, pierdes tus predicciones.
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step-item">
      <div class="step-num">4</div>
      <div class="step-text">
        La próxima vez que entres, solo escribe tu código y listo — la app te recuerda automáticamente.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="alert warn" style="margin-top:16px;">
    <div class="alert-icon">⚠️</div>
    <div class="alert-text">
      <strong>INSCRIPCIONES CIERRAN EL 10 DE JUNIO</strong><br>
      El registro se bloquea el <strong>11 de junio a las 2:00 PM (hora Colombia)</strong> cuando empieza el primer partido. ¡No lo dejes para después!
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="alert info">
    <div class="alert-icon">💵</div>
    <div class="alert-text">
      <strong>Inscripción: $50.000 COP</strong> por persona<br>
      Pago por Nequi / Daviplata / Bancolombia al número: <strong style="color:#5b9eff">311 450 2969</strong><br>
      <span style="color:var(--muted)">Sin pago confirmado, tus predicciones no cuentan. 🚫</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="divider"></div>

<!-- ═══════════ PASO 2: GRUPOS ═══════════ -->
<div class="section">
